cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CUDA-EP-001: ExecutionProof Pre-GPU Preregistration and Reproducibility Package"
message: "If you reference this package, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Hone
    given-names: Derek
    affiliation: "Remnant Fieldworks Inc."
version: v0.1-pre-gpu
date-released: 2026-10-02
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/derekhone/executionproof-testbeds"
abstract: >
  Frozen pre-GPU state of CUDA-EP-001, a preregistered experiment testing whether
  an ExecutionProof authorization gateway permits the exact attested CUDA artifact
  to launch only under a valid ALLOW condition on real NVIDIA GPU hardware. No real
  GPU execution has occurred; GPU-C0 through GPU-C8 remain unexecuted. CPU-surrogate
  results are included as supporting pre-GPU evidence only.
